cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "linecat: a viewer for spectral line catalogs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Anari
    given-names: Vahid
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2464-3989"
version: 0.14.0
date-released: "2026-10-23"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vahid-anari/linecat"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23487626
url: "https://pypi.org/project/linecat/"
abstract: >-
  Line Catalog Explorer (linecat) is a desktop application for spectral line
  catalogs from CDMS: filter the lines of a molecule by frequency and quantum
  numbers, sort and export the table, and draw energy-level diagrams of the
  selected transitions for figures and LaTeX. Catalogs of OH, CH3OH, SiO and
  NH3 are included.
keywords:
  - spectral line catalogs
  - CDMS
  - molecular spectroscopy
  - energy-level diagrams
  - astrochemistry
  - PySide6
